[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3093225777","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108782#issuecomment-3093225777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108782","id":3093225777,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64XuEx","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T05:49:34Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T05:49:34Z","body":"I don't think it's the style of the XML tag that's the issue, but that the documentation is referring to the property override, not to the original definition in the base class.\r\n\r\nThe difference between a paired tag and a self-closing tag is that property overrides don't have a separate description, so there is no need a space for the description text. I don't think this should be changed, but if it were, you'd need to change `DocTools`.\r\n\r\nInstead, I suggest you check if the reference to the property override is correct. If not, it should be replaced with a reference to the original definition in the base class. Otherwise, we should add support for this to `make_rst.py`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3093225777/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094558184","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108782#issuecomment-3094558184","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108782","id":3094558184,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64czXo","user":{"login":"skyace65","id":6080368,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODAzNjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6080368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65","html_url":"https://github.com/skyace65","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T14:08:02Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T14:08:02Z","body":"> , I suggest you check if the reference to the property override is correct. If not, it should be replaced with a reference to the original definition in the base class. Otherwise, we should add support for this to\r\n\r\nThis is the part of code causing issues :ref:step<class_SpinBox_property_step> (Removed the \"`\" because of github formatting). as far as I can tell it looks correct, that's how every property link is, the word class, the class name, property, and the name of the property. How would I replace this with a reference to the original definition?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094558184/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096244544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108782#issuecomment-3096244544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108782","id":3096244544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64jPFA","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T11:12:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T11:12:03Z","body":"I'm seeing this issue. The `step` property isn't defined in the `SpinBox` class, it's defined in `Range`. See how `step` in the `SpinBox`'s properties list isn't linking anywhere, because it's only documented in the `Range` class. I guess the reference should be to the `class_Range_property_step` instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096244544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096304571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108782#issuecomment-3096304571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108782","id":3096304571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64jdu7","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T11:29:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T12:00:39Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/71a9948157dc2d5cc71fcb456c9d96656678757d/doc/classes/SpinBox.xml#L52-L55\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n-[b]Note:[/b] [member Range.value] will still be rounded to a multiple of [member step].\r\n+[b]Note:[/b] [member Range.value] will still be rounded to a multiple of [member Range.step].\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso please add the following to `doc/tools/make_rst.py`, to prevent similar mistakes in the future:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n@@ -2150,6 +2150,11 @@ def format_text_block(\r\n                                         f'{state.current_class}.xml: Unresolved member reference \"{link_target}\" in {context_name}.',\r\n                                         state,\r\n                                     )\r\n+                                elif class_def.properties[target_name].overrides is not None:\r\n+                                    print_error(\r\n+                                        f'{state.current_class}.xml: Invalid member reference \"{link_target}\" in {context_name}.',\r\n+                                        state,\r\n+                                    )\r\n \r\n                             elif tag_state.name == \"signal\" and target_name not in class_def.signals:\r\n                                 print_error(\r\n```\r\n\r\n* A regression from #108196. CC @beicause","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096304571/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096469501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108782#issuecomment-3096469501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108782","id":3096469501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64kF_9","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beica